1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,631
Meet Learn Anywhere, a learning companion designed around a simple idea: useful lessons should fit into everyday life.

2
00:00:07,771 --> 00:00:11,973
Find a course, save its text lessons, and work through them at your own pace.

3
00:00:12,113 --> 00:00:16,891
This walkthrough shows the journey from discovering a topic to checking what you have learned.

4
00:00:20,397 --> 00:00:21,722
Start on Discover.

5
00:00:21,861 --> 00:00:26,354
Browse the available courses or use search to find a topic that interests you.

6
00:00:26,493 --> 00:00:31,177
The course cards give you a starting point, and opening a course shows what it contains.

7
00:00:31,316 --> 00:00:39,211
These artificial intelligence courses use original text lessons and practical examples, with source references for further reading.

8
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,225
The course contents screen lays out the learning route.

9
00:00:43,365 --> 00:00:46,757
You can see the lessons and the final quiz before you begin.

10
00:00:46,897 --> 00:00:50,395
Open the first lesson, or jump to a topic you need today.

11
00:00:50,535 --> 00:00:56,955
Jumping ahead does not mark the skipped lessons as read, so reading progress stays separate from quiz completion.

12
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,671
Save the course while you have a connection.

13
00:01:02,811 --> 00:01:08,249
Once the pack is on your device, the app identifies the saved material as ready offline.

14
00:01:08,389 --> 00:01:12,814
That means you can return to its text lessons without downloading them again.

15
00:01:12,954 --> 00:01:17,796
Downloads brings together the courses and languages already saved on this device.

16
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:25,636
Inside a lesson, follow the headings and examples, then try the suggested activity.

17
00:01:25,776 --> 00:01:28,772
Reading time helps you plan a small learning session.

18
00:01:28,912 --> 00:01:31,163
Bookmark a lesson you want to revisit.

19
00:01:31,303 --> 00:01:38,119
The app saves reading progress, while opening or returning to a page starts at the top, giving you a clear starting point.

20
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:43,215
Use Read aloud when listening works better for you.

21
00:01:43,355 --> 00:01:50,073
The reading controls include playback speed, and Profile lets you choose whether lessons start reading automatically.

22
00:01:50,213 --> 00:01:53,519
Listening is another way to engage with the same lesson.

23
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:58,533
It does not replace checking the examples or completing the activities in your own words.

24
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,160
Need a simpler starting point?

25
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:03,888
Tap the lightbulb button.

26
00:02:04,028 --> 00:02:09,510
The lesson changes in place to a shorter explained version, rather than opening another page.

27
00:02:09,650 --> 00:02:12,124
Tap again to return to the regular text.

28
00:02:12,264 --> 00:02:17,745
You can also choose to start with explained lessons when setting up or editing your learner profile.

29
00:02:20,390 --> 00:02:26,657
The reference card keeps the lesson's sources visible without repeating a bibliography inside the reading text.

30
00:02:26,794 --> 00:02:31,062
Use these links when you want to explore the topic further or check its background.

31
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:39,213
Saved lessons remain available offline, but opening an external website requires a connection and takes you beyond the saved lesson.

32
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:42,799
When you are ready, open the final quiz.

33
00:02:42,939 --> 00:02:45,744
Choose an answer and continue through the questions.

34
00:02:45,884 --> 00:02:50,235
The app saves your answers without revealing correctness during the assessment.

35
00:02:50,375 --> 00:02:56,251
Submit to see your score, then use answer review to examine the correct answers and explanations.

36
00:02:56,391 --> 00:02:59,185
Treat the result as guidance for what to revisit.

37
00:03:00,382 --> 00:03:04,706
Choose English, French, Portuguese, Arabic, Hausa, Yoruba, or Igbo.

38
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:08,028
One preference guides the app labels and lesson language.

39
00:03:08,162 --> 00:03:12,399
When an available language pack is missing, the app downloads it while connected.

40
00:03:12,533 --> 00:03:14,671
Saved packs can then be read offline.

41
00:03:14,805 --> 00:03:19,216
Availability can vary by course, and Arabic uses a right to left layout.

42
00:03:20,382 --> 00:03:22,529
Profile brings your preferences together.

43
00:03:22,662 --> 00:03:27,515
Choose teal light or teal dark, adjust the font size, and manage reading options.

44
00:03:27,648 --> 00:03:30,721
Learning material and activity are saved on your device.

45
00:03:30,854 --> 00:03:39,216
Synchronization sends necessary learning activity to the backend when connected, and the app does not require a learner email or password to begin.

46
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:43,727
To get started, choose one topic that will help you today.

47
00:03:43,867 --> 00:03:48,880
Save the course while connected, read or listen to one lesson, and try its activity.

48
00:03:49,020 --> 00:03:52,305
Use the explained version whenever you need a simpler view.

49
00:03:52,445 --> 00:03:57,457
Return to the full lesson for detail, and take the final quiz to guide your next step.
